    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You have inherited the physiology of the Night Adder clan. You have thinner scales and bear a shorter and skinny frame, and your tongue’s coloration changes with the pigmentation of your scales as you change them. You replace your ancestral attribute bonus to Strength with Dexterity. When you Hide or Take Cover, you can change your scale pigments temporarily to match the background. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your Stealth DC against creatures you are Hidden or Undetected from.</span></p>"
